This covers the generated JSON Schemas (schemas/), the rules (rules/), the
intermediate representation (ir/), the mapping (mapping/), the decision records
(decisions/), the documents (README.md, docs/), and every other file outside the
software code listed below: comparison/, corpus/, examples/, feedback/,
field-examples/, kernel/, plain-generator/, releases/, roundtrip/,
type-examples/, variants/, and vectors/. These files adapt the OpenProposal
Specification by IAB Tech Lab, which is itself licensed under a Creative Commons
Attribution 3.0 License; see NOTICE.

The snapshots under spec-input/snapshots/ are the OpenProposal Specification
and its examples by IAB Tech Lab, under IAB Tech Lab's Creative Commons
Attribution 3.0 License. spec-input/snapshots/with-open-prs/ merges open pull
requests into it, and the lock and spec-input/INTEGRATION*.md record each
change.

Software code in this repository (src/, gates/, scripts/, tools/, test/,
.github/workflows/, package.json, package-lock.json, tsconfig.json, and the
generated TypeScript, Python, and Go types under sdk/) is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. See LICENSE-CODE.

This is an independent work, not a product of IAB Tech Lab, and it implies no
endorsement by IAB Tech Lab.
